Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Reaload Cache: Done
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cache/entries/global-config/reload
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Relationship Managers
