### Scheduler Management APIs (requires company.scheduler.management-endpoints.enabled=true)

### Get Scheduler Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/secured/scheduler/stat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Stop Scheduler
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/secured/scheduler/stop
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Restart Scheduler
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/secured/scheduler/restart
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "jobGroupName": "referenceData"
}

### Restart Scheduler for Specific Jobs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/secured/scheduler/refresh/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "jobGroupName": "referenceData",
    "jobIds": ["cacheReloadJob"]
}

### Unregister Jobs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/secured/scheduler/unregister/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

["cacheReloadJob"]

### Hard Stop Scheduler
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/secured/scheduler/hardstop
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}